 will kill the mother  of his child  ned stark would never do something like  that so we would assume  jon would not either but can you just  imagine if he did  imagine if he had to make that choice it  would have been so much more devastating  like i said at the beginning of the  video i did not feel anything when jon  killed danny at the end of season 8  and i know i'm not the only one who felt  this way either i have seen hundreds or  even thousands of fans say the same  thing  it was so rushed it was hard to feel  anything at all  after they made danny go crazy and burn  down king's landing  we all knew that john had to kill her it  was so obvious by then  but if dany would have been carrying  their child or if this would have  happened shortly after she had their  child  it would have been shocking i know i  would have felt bad for all of them  not only john but danny and the baby as  well obviously  but i don't know maybe this sounds too  dark for some of you  but i think it would have added so much  more to that scene  you also have to think about what this  would have done to tyrion  psychologically  remember he's the one who basically  convinced john to go kill her  now imagine if tyrion knew that danny  was pregnant we all know how he wanted  to help save a sister because she was  now pregnant again  imagine if tyrion had to convince john  to kill dany  knowing she was the mother of his child  if that doesn't have an effect on you  then i don't know what will as i said  before they already had all this set up  by the end of season 7.  i think they made a big mistake by not  following through  let me know your thoughts on this what  would you have done to make danny's  death scene better  do you agree with what i said or am i  crazy for wanting to add a baby to the  mix  leave your thoughts down below in my  next video i will be discussing ned  stark's first chapter in a game of  thrones and after that  i will make a video on fire and blood to  help us get 